      "uid": "zhcn:4229d3427fa963489c61686b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天狼星象征顺利地达成了\n她在新年时宣布的目标。",
      "source_fingerprint": "700d07344205c0ee0304cde9f776e052914ec1e7e4d8c934ac95dbb728ef6e5a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
