      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过她果然还是原本那位\n坚强又可靠的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9830c4921e7fff118f4fb05e4cb171adcd9a86b73cc6de938b7a5404033bfa7",
