      "uid": "zhcn:8a5237b1dfe090d5ef1d8b37",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我告诉她，\n现在还没决定下一场目标竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a949b4cc5f2627ae74d57a468fee01dff64791a88659bcb1f31067536922926",
