      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要是挑战年底的“有马纪念”，\n应该颇适合作为最后一场国内比赛，\n我原本是这么想，但──",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcdbc8a6d5dcf2d5734ca80af7de40935c2b2f1338d8eede3b7b1807852c3c14",
